==Trivia==
*Mutated Bloodvelds had a festive override wearing a [[santa hat]] during the [[2023 Christmas event/Gallery|2023]], [[2024 Christmas event/Gallery|2024]], and [[2025 Christmas event/Gallery|2025]] Christmas events.
*Mutated bloodvelds were originally released as part of the {{RSL|Legacy of Seergaze}} quest in ''RuneScape 3'' in [[2008]]. Unlike the mutated bloodvelds in ''Old School RuneScape'', they used a vastly different model compared to normal bloodveld, resembling a cross between a human and a bloodveld, whereas the normal and mutated bloodvelds of ''Old School RuneScape'' simply have their tongue and mouth colours swapped. Their examine text is also notably different.

